  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "42",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 42"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "42",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe tupitene tuonso tua bena nvita ne Yohanana, muana wa Kalea, ne Yezanya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.1:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Yelemiya 43.2, Azâya. Tangila 2 Bakelenge 23.23.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " muana wa Hoshaya, ne bantu bonso bakuabo, kudi udi mutambe kuhuekela tô ne kudi udi mutambe bunene, bakasemena ha buihi nʼandi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakambila Yelemiya muprofete ne, Tudi tukusengelela bua kunvua kutendekena kuetu, utulombele Yehowa Nzambi webe, tuetu bantu aba bonso badi bashala, bualu bua tuakushala anu bakese ba ku bantu ba diambedi, bu mudi mesu ebe amona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utulombele bua Yehowa Nzambi webe atuleshe nshila utudi ne bua kuendela ne muanda utudi ne bua kuenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yelemiya muprofete wakabambila ne, Nakunvua disengelela dienu. Monai, nennulombele Yehowa Nzambi wenu bu munuakuamba, ne nennuambile mei onso adi Yehowa ungambila bua bualu buenu; tshiena nnusokoka dî dimue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bakambila Yelemiya ne, Yehowa ikale mumanyi wa bushuwa ne utudi mua kueyemena, bua atuhishe bituikala katuyi benze dî dionso didi Yehowa Nzambi webe ututumina mukana muebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikala dî diandi ditusankisha anyi kadiyi ditusankisha, netutumikile dî dia Yehowa Nzambi wetu, utudi tukutuma, bua tuetu tuikale ne diakalengele hatuatumikila dî dia Yehowa Nzambi wetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahita matuku dikumi, dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudi Yelemiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku yeye wakabikila Yohanana, muana wa Kalea, ne tupitene tuonso tua bena nvita tuakadi nʼandi, ne bantu bonso kudi udi mutambe kuhuekela tô ne kudi udi mutambe bunene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakabambila ne, Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, kunuakuntuma bua kufila kutendekena kuenu, udi wamba ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binuashala mu buloba ebu, nennuase kabidi ne tshiena nnusasula, nennukune ne tshiena nnujula; bualu bua ndi nkudimuna mutshima wanyi bua makenga anakunutumina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Kanutshinyi mukelenge wa Babulona unudi nutshina katataka, kanumutshinyi; bualu bua meme ndi nʼenu bua kunusungila ne bua kunuhandisha mu bianza biandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nennufute luse, nentekeshe mutshima wandi bua yeye anufuile luse, anuhingashe mu buloba buenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi binuamba ne, Katuena tushikama mu buloba ebu, nubenga bienu dî dia Yehowa Nzambi wenu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "binuamba ne, Nansha, netuye mu buloba bua Ejipitu mutudi katuyi tumona nvita, katuyi tunvua muadi wa mpungi wa nvita, katuyi ne nzala ya bia kudia, netushikamemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nunku unvuai dî dia Yehowa, nuenu ba mu Yuda batshidi bashala. Yehowa wa misumba, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Binuatangisha mpala yenu bua kuya ku Ejipitu, binuayaku bua kushikama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muele wa nvita unudi nutshina neunuhete mu buloba bua Ejipitu, ne tshiole tshinudi nutshina netshinulonde ku nyima kuenu kuakua mu Ejipitu; nenufuileku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bonso badi batangisha mpala yabo bua kuya ku Ejipitu bua kushikamaku nebafue ku muele wa nvita, ku tshiole ne ku tshihuhu, ne kakuena umue wabo washala anyi wahanduka mu makenga andi mbatumina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Yehowa wa misumba, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Bu munakukuatshila Bena Yelushalema tshifikʼa munda ne tshiji tshianyi tshikole, nunku nennukuatshile tshiji tshianyi tshikole hanuabuela mu Ejipitu. Nenuikale bu tshintu tshidibo bahenda, tshidi tshikuatshisha bantu buowa, tshidibo bela mulau ne tshidibo bahetula. Kanuena nutangila muaba eu kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakungambila dî edi bua bualu buenu, nuenu ba mu Yuda badi bashala ne muoyo, ne, Kanuyi mu Ejipitu! Numanye bienu bimpe ne, Nakunudimusha lelu eu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuakudienzela nkayenu bibi. Bualu bua nuakuntuma kudi Yehowa Nzambi wenu ne, Utulombele Yehowa Nzambi wetu; utuambile dî dionso didi Yehowa wamba, ne tuetu netudienze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelu eu nakunuambila dî edi, kadi kanuakutumikila dî dia Yehowa Nzambi wenu mu bualu bumue buakuntumeye bua kunuambila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku numanye bienu ne, Nenufue ku muele wa nvita, ku tshiole ne ku tshihuhu mu muaba unudi basue kuya bua kushikama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
